                 line="506">snapshot options. Anything but
  %GJSIFY_WEBVIEW2_SNAPSHOT_OPTIONS_NONE is IGNORED and warns once:
  `CapturePreview` has no transparent-background and no
  selection-highlighting option, so the capture is of the page as composited.</doc>
            <type name="SnapshotOptions"
                  c:type="GjsifyWebView2SnapshotOptions"/>
